            "office": "Crown Prince of the Jin Dynasty",
            "raw": "{{circa}}February 267{{efn|Both Emperor Wu's biography in ''Jin Shu'' and vol.79 of ''Zizhi Tongjian'' indicated that Sima Zhong was made crown prince on the ''ding'mao'' day of the 1st month of the 3rd year of the ''Tai'shi'' era. However, that month did not have a ''ding'mao'' day; the month corresponds to 11 Feb to 12 Mar 267 in the Julian calendar. The nearest ''ding'mao'' days are in the month before and after. It is possible that the correct month was the 2nd ({{lang|zh|二}}; compare and contrast with the character \"{{lang|zh|正}}\" [zheng]) month; the corresponding date in the Julian calendar is 5 April 267.}} – 16 May 290",
